# Never commit the ROM itself, program images, the Ghidra database or decompiled code.
# Exception (user decision 2026-10-12, the repo is always private): the asset dump re/out/assets/
# (pictures, animations, maps, text, samples rendered by re/tools/dump_assets.sh) IS committed.
*.zip
re/rom/
re/out/*
!re/out/assets/
re/ghidra/proj/
re/ghidra/*.elf
re/ghidra/decomp*
re/ghidra/log*.txt
*.npy
*.png
*.bin
!re/out/assets/**
# Raw disassembly / decompiler dumps of the original program
re/specs/**/*_dis.txt
re/specs/enemy/c2.txt
re/specs/enemy/hit_2a606.txt

# Tooling
re/.venv/
__pycache__/
dino-rs/target/
.DS_Store
re/specs/**/scratch*/
.claude/*.lock
re/mame/roms/
# MAME runtime output
cfg/
nvram/
# A player's settings file (plan D5)
dino.cfg
dino-config.json
